
  Review the settings for Field Notes

  Domain            fieldnotes.example.com
                    the only domain on your account
  Address         > blog.fieldnotes.example.com                                
                    That address already points to another
                    site. Choose another address, or remove
                    its DNS records in Cloudflare first.
  Sign-in email     sam@example.com
                    from your Cloudflare account

  Repository        field-notes
  Worker            field-notes
  Database          field-notes-auth
  Storage bucket    field-notes-media
                    based on your site name

  Theme             Waymark
                    An intentionally neutral look that's easy to edit.
  AI crawlers       Block AI training

  Deploys           GitHub Actions, each time you publish
                    free for about 650 deploys a month · cairn.pub/deploys

